<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Corporation may elect any of its members to be the chairman of a committee. Corporation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
