<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "A member of a committee may, at any time, resign by giving a notice in writing to the chairman of the committee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_11> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
