<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A member of the Corporation or any committee who has or acquires a direct or indirect interest by himself, through a member of his family or his associate in relation to any matter under discussion by the Corporation or committee, as the case may be, shall disclose to the Corporation or committee, as the case may be, the fact of his interest and the nature of that interest."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
