<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The common seal of the Corporation shall be kept in the custody of the Chief Executive Officer or any officer of the Corporation authorized by the Corporation and shall be authenticated by either the Chairman or by such other members of the Corporation authorized by the Chairman in writing."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
