<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21> <https://schema.org/text> "( 1 ) The Chief Executive Officer shall be appointed by the Minister, on the recommendation of the Corporation."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
