<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chief Executive Officer shall hold office for a term not exceeding three years and shall be eligible for reappointment upon the expiry of his term of office."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chief Executive Officer shall be deemed to be an officer or employee of the Corporation and be subject to the terms and conditions of service as may be determined by the Corporation with the approval of the Minister."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
