<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chief Executive Officer shall enjoy such compensation and such other amenities as approved by the Minister, upon recommendation of the Corporation."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
