<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The Corporation shall vest in the Chief Executive Officer such powers and impose upon him such duties as may be determined by the Corporation."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
