<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chief Executive Officer shall be responsible for the overall administration and management of the functions and the day to day affairs of the Corporation. Corporation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
