<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26> <https://schema.org/text> "The Corporation may adopt with such modifications as it deems fit any regulations, rules, policies, circulars and directives enacted or issued by the Federal Government in relation to any matter under this Part."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
