<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_VI__cl_39> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chairman, members of the Corporation and of any committee, officers, employees and agents of the Corporation, while discharging their duties under this Act as Chairman, such members, officers, employees or agents, shall be deemed to be public servants within the meaning of the Penal Code [Act 574]. Public Authorities Protection Act 1948"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
