<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45> <https://schema.org/text> "All things done by any person or authority on behalf of the Corporation in the preparation of and towards the proper administration of this Act, and any expenditure incurred in relation thereto, in anticipation of the enactment of this Act shall Corporation be deemed to have been authorized by this Act, and all rights acquired or obligations incurred on behalf of the Corporation from anything so done shall upon the coming into operation of this Act be deemed to be the rights and obligations of the Corporation."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
