<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The expenditure of the Corporation up to such amount as may be authorized by the Minister for any one year shall be defrayed out of the Fund."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_30> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
