<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_31> <https://schema.org/text> "The Corporation shall open and maintain an account or accounts with such bank or banks in Malaysia as it thinks fit, after consulting the Minister, and every such account shall be operated upon as far as practicable by cheques signed by any person as may be authorized by the Corporation for such purpose from time to time. Power to borrow"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_32> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_32> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "32" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
