<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The moneys from the Corporation Fund shall, in so far as they are not required to be expended by the Corporation under this Act, be invested in such manner as the Minister and the Minister of Finance may approve."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
