<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Without prejudice to the generality of subsection (1), the Corporation may, with the approval of the Minister, acquire and develop land and properties for or in connection with the exercise of its powers and for this purpose may enter into such negotiations, arrangements or agreements as may be necessary for the effective and efficient operation of the Corporation. Limitations on contracts"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_34> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
