<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_34> <https://schema.org/text> "The Corporation shall not, without the approval of the Minister and the Minister of Finance, enter into any contract under which the Corporation is to pay or receive an amount exceeding ten million ringgit. Financial procedure"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
