<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_35> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to this Act and the approval of the Minister, the Corporation shall determine its own financial procedure. Financial year"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/26/eng@> .
